\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Moving a two-link pattern}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{On a circle with two vertices, the two positive
labeled links can carry different values. Exchanging
the vertices exchanges those labels as well. How
should the same shift act on a cochain and on its
connection, and when does it preserve one fixed
operator?}
